# Env: `.env` is local and NOT committed. react-native-dotenv reads it at
# build time; copy `.env.example` to `.env` after cloning. Only the
# `.env.example` template is tracked. All values are public, non-secret config.
.env
.env.local

# fastlane
#
# It is recommended to not store the screenshots in the git repo. Instead, use fastlane to re-generate the
